            "    \\textbf{Fusion Method} & \\textbf{\\# Parameters} & \\textbf{RougeL} & \\textbf{Avg. Acc} \\\\ \\hline\n",
            "    Fusion-1 & 254M & \\textbf{98.29} & \\textbf{91.65} \\\\ \n",
            "    Fusion-2 & 251M & 98.23 & 91.23 \\\\ \n",
            "    Fusion-3 & 250M & 98.14 & 90.14 \\\\ \\hline\n",
            "    \\end{tabular}\n",
            "    \\caption{Comparative performance of the varying fusion methods. Fusion-1 outperforms the other fusion methods.}\n",
